-- ASSUMPTION [party_type_not_filtered]: POZ_SUPPLIERS.PARTY_ID is assumed to point at an organization row only; no HZ_PARTIES.PARTY_TYPE predicate is emitted. OQ-3, unverified.
--- end SQL projection ---

